{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777930/extras/4b93142a4b930461087ae77c31d78822.poster.avif?t=1774384771\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=1170 height=570 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777930/extras/4b93142a4b930461087ae77c31d78822.webm?t=1774384771\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777930/extras/4b93142a4b930461087ae77c31d78822.mp4?t=1774384771\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncle Lee has done it again. And again. And again. And again. And again. It\u2019s up to you to pick up the pieces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join rebellious teen Ines as she deals with the fallout of her uncle Lee\u2019s experiments/inventions/cooking\u2014only you can help her save the universe!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience five episodes of reality-bending puzzles, witty dialogues, weird characters, and gorgeous pixel art (no, <strong>you </strong>are biased) in a wonderful package of point &amp; click gloriousness. You get all of the adventures of Ines and uncle Lee for the first time all together, revised and improved, and most importantly WITH VOICES. What more could you want?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777930/extras/1641465c8c9b2326447da964d802caaf.poster.avif?t=1774384771\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=1170 height=650 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777930/extras/1641465c8c9b2326447da964d802caaf.webm?t=1774384771\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777930/extras/1641465c8c9b2326447da964d802caaf.mp4?t=1774384771\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Main features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 self-contained episodes of various durations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging but fair puzzles with solutions that make sense\u2122.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Science! Magic! Science <strong>and</strong> Magic! So many ways to break the universe\u2026</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built-in hint system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catchy and dynamic original soundtrack.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >English voices with subtitles in English and Italian.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Native Linux version that works great on the Steam Deck.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Episode synopses</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777930/extras/3fb6b35345b97d07386eb658d3fbc40f.poster.avif?t=1774384771\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=960 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777930/extras/3fb6b35345b97d07386eb658d3fbc40f.webm?t=1774384771\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777930/extras/3fb6b35345b97d07386eb658d3fbc40f.mp4?t=1774384771\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncle Lee broke quantum mechanics and wavefunction collapse now affects macroscopic objects\u2014Ice cream included.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A 10-year-old Ines would really, REALLY, like to go to the bathroom this morning, but her whole world is literally upside down.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A relaxing trip to <i>Lake Fenfef</i> goes all wrong when uncle Lee butt-dials a time machine and leaves Ines stranded in time with nothing but a broken reality-fixing device\u2122.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An older Ines visits [redacted], uncle Lee\u2019s hometown, to get inspiration for a book she\u2019s writing. On her arrival she finds a mysteriously empty town, and her book-writing plans are derailed as she is recruited to save [redacted] from a paranormal infestation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s Ines\u2019 20th birthday. Uncle Lee had the most amazing idea for a birthday present, which can only mean trouble.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3777930?t=1774384771","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777930/fb74d96edd045667f5e8a6b82959e2f5ce3dce43/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774384771","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777930/ae5d30a76b9c48879dc7e0244a66f1bbfd04aa56/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774384771","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777930/ae5d30a76b9c48879dc7e0244a66f1bbfd04aa56/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774384771","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3996880,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">